Z||000004||TRiAD||11-23-2001||07:40 PM||||The pic is of a resin model. <P>The kit is 100% custom, so I should've put this in OT, sorry.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>BUT, it's a completely custom tube frame kit with your choice of drivetrain, options, etc...<P>I would probably do a Skyline engine engine and 6sp manual...<P>Anyway, I just thought it was cool...||||reg||1
Z||000005||rogergarrison||11-24-2001||04:58 AM||||There is an older kit or the Porsche 917 GTP car around. Its called a Lazer 917, uses a VW platform and most are way underpowered with VW flat 4s. Looks a lot like that. seats practicly lay down. Downside is that they were all gaudy metalflake gel coat.||||reg||1
